# 🧩 Miscellaneous (Misc) CTF Challenges

> Beginner-friendly guide to solving Misc CTF challenges through practical investigation, scripting, and creative problem-solving.

## 🎯 Purpose & Role

**Misc** contains challenges that do not fit neatly into Web, Crypto, Pwn, Reverse Engineering, or Forensics.

It tests your ability to:

- 🧠 Think creatively
- 🔍 Investigate unfamiliar data
- 🛠️ Combine different techniques
- 🐍 Automate repetitive tasks

## 🧩 Common Challenge Types

| Type | Examples |
|---|---|
| 🔐 Encoding | Base64, Hex, URL, Binary |
| 🖼️ Stego | Hidden data in images/audio |
| 📁 File Analysis | Metadata, magic bytes, embedded files |
| 🌐 Network | PCAP, DNS, HTTP |
| 🤖 Automation | Repetitive/manual tasks |
| 🧠 Logic | Patterns, puzzles, unusual formats |
| 🔎 OSINT | Public information gathering |
| 🔀 Multi-step | Multiple techniques combined |

## 🧠 Key Skills

- File and data identification
- Encoding/decoding
- Metadata analysis
- Hex and string inspection
- Network analysis
- Python scripting
- Pattern recognition
- Basic OSINT and research

